<title>UK: BZW appoints head of North America sales.</title>
<headline>BZW appoints head of North America sales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW, the investment banking unit of Barclays Plc, said on Thursday it has appointed John Cregan, previously of Morgan Stanley, as managing director and head of sales for its global markets division in North America.</p>
<p>Cregan, 42, ran Morgan Stanley's Chicago fixed income operations and previously worked for Smith Barney.</p>
<p>Callum McCarthy, BZW's North America chief executive, said the appointment reinforces BZW's strategy of increasing client focus in the continent.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8864</p>
